goscape — third-party notices and attribution
=============================================

goscape is a from-scratch Go port; it vendors no third-party source verbatim,
but the following projects are the reference implementations it derives from,
and their license terms are acknowledged here.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Lost City — Engine-TS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

goscape is a Go rewrite of the Lost City TypeScript RuneScape server
(https://github.com/LostCityRS/Engine-TS), wire-protocol revision 225. Game
logic, protocol framing, content-compiler semantics, and data formats are
ported from that codebase.

