-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Grafana — dskit
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

pkg/dskit/ is a Go port/adaptation of selected packages from Grafana's dskit
(https://github.com/grafana/dskit): service lifecycle state machine, module
dependency manager, server wrapper, and related utilities.

dskit is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of the license
is available at https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

Copyright Grafana Labs. Changes from the upstream: translated/adapted for
goscape's module set, logging (log/slog), and configuration conventions.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Build scaffolding
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

The Makefile structure is adapted from Grafana Loki's build scaffolding
(https://github.com/grafana/loki, AGPL-3.0). Only generic build-target
structure is retained; no Loki source code is included.
